.DS_Store

# Fetched HTML corpus IS committed (not ignored): EDS only ever serves today
# + 3 days ahead, so a given day's snapshot is gone for good once it passes —
# it isn't reproducible later. The daily fetch cloud routine depends on this:
# each run clones fresh with no local disk to carry state between days, so
# fixtures/ in git is the only place the corpus accumulates. Curated,
# hand-picked fixtures for fast test runs still live under test/fixtures/.
